{"key": "KXPPFUNDING|Will Planned Parenthood be defunded?|If Planned Parenthood is defunded or prohibited from receiving government funds before Jan 1, 2026, then the market resolves to Yes.", "decision": "YES", "confidence": 0.75, "reasoning": "The \"One Big Beautiful Bill Act\" signed into law on July 4, 2025 included a provision blocking Medicaid reimbursements to Planned Parenthood. While courts initially blocked enforcement (July-August 2025), appeals courts overturned those blocks (September-December 2025), allowing the Trump administration to enforce the defunding before January 1, 2026. This meets the resolution criteria of \"defunded or prohibited from receiving government funds before Jan 1, 2026.\" The defunding primarily affected Medicaid reimbursements, which is a form of government funding.", "sources": ["https://www.axios.com/2025/07/07/planned-parenthood-sues-defund-provision", "https://abc13.com/amp/post/judge-blocks-trump-administrations-efforts-defund-planned-parenthood/17336250/", "https://san.com/?p=440476", "https://www.dailysignal.com/?p=63232", "https://fortune.com/2025/07/28/planned-parenthood-medicaid-funds-judge-indira-talwani-rfk-jr"], "queries": ["Planned Parenthood defunded government funding 2025", "Planned Parenthood prohibited government funds January 2026", "\"Planned Parenthood\" defund July 2025 Medicaid", "Planned Parenthood federal funding court ruling 2025"], "links": ["https://www.notus.org/courts/ruling-defunding-planned-parenthood-blocked", "https://www.congress.gov/119/bills/s203/BILLS-119s203is.htm", "https://thealabamabaptist.org/?p=103058", "https://news.yahoo.com/planned-parenthood-refuses-comply-trump-153754657.html", "https://news.bgov.com/bloomberg-government-news/planned-parenthood-medicaid-funding-set-to-resume-explained", "https://news.bgov.com/daily-labor-report/planned-parenthood-medicaid-funding-set-to-resume-explained", "https://lailluminator.com/2025/11/24/repub/defund-planned-parenthood/", "https://news.bloo